  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kebbi - Sangara Agro Allied Producers and Markers Groundnut Production and Processing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Groundnut Beneficiaries: 106 (93 female) Description: This Cooperative Association, located in Kebbi State, seeks grant funds to upgrade its equipment, construct a processing center, and professionalize its staff in order to increase productivity of its members and increase incomes of its member households. This grant is part of the USADF-Kebbi State partnership agreement and will be funded 50/50 USADF appropriated funds and funds put up from the government of Kebbi State, Nigeria.</narrative>
  </description>
